135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 402 0 R
/E (A downloaded model is only a set of weight files that uses disk space. A loaded model has its weights read into RAM / VRAM and is ready to answer; it uses memory, and the first request after a cold start pays a loading delay. Ollama unloads an idle model after the keep_alive period \(5 minutes by default\).)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
