/P 76 0 R
/E (Why does the model remember the name? Is the LLM itself remembering?)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 76 0 R
/E (Answers)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 410 0 R
/E (The model remembers the name because the application sends the previous conversation with each request. The LLM is stateless, so it does not store memories itself. The conversation history is stored in a Python list and sent through the /api/chat endpoint. As the conversation grows, the prompt gets longer and may exceed the context window, so old messages may need to be shortened or summarized.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
