<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 411 0 R
/E (Structured output is important because software needs predictable data. JSON Schema ensures the LLM returns data in the correct format, with the required fields and types. This makes it easier to validate and use the output in applications. However, correct formatting does not guarantee correct information.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
